<body>
<div class="page">

<header>
<div class="eyebrow">Pre-deck review</div>
<h1>Three framings — <span class="accent">one battlefield</span> chosen.</h1>
<p class="lede">The same three categories — Cloud ERP, Low-Code, No-Code — plotted on three different sets of axes. Each framing tells a different story to a different buyer mindset. The third is the recommended battlefield for Velo Working's positioning.</p>
</header>

<div class="section-strip">
<div class="label">Three candidate framings</div>
<div class="meta">A · Economics framing &nbsp;·&nbsp; B · Organisational framing &nbsp;·&nbsp; C · Battlefield framing →</div>
</div>

<div class="grid-3">

<!-- FRAMING A: Economics -->

<div class="card">
<div class="card-eyebrow">
<span>Framing A</span>
<span>Economics</span>
</div>
<div class="card-title">3-year TCO &times; Time to adapt</div>
<div class="card-axes">X-axis: <strong>Total cost of ownership (3 years)</strong><br>Y-axis: <strong>Time to adapt to a process change</strong></div>

<div class="card-svg">
<svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Economics framing matrix">
<!-- Frame -->
<rect x="60" y="40" width="320" height="280" fill="#F7F5F0" stroke="#D7D0BF"/>
<line x1="220" y1="40" x2="220" y2="320" stroke="#D7D0BF" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
<line x1="60" y1="180" x2="380" y2="180" stroke="#D7D0BF" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>

<!-- Axes -->

<line x1="60" y1="340" x2="380" y2="340" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2"/>
<polyline points="375,336 383,340 375,344" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
<line x1="40" y1="320" x2="40" y2="40" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2"/>
<polyline points="36,46 40,38 44,46" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>

<!-- Axis labels -->

<text x="220" y="358" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">LOW COST →</text>
<text x="20" y="180" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1" transform="rotate(-90 20 180)">FASTER →</text>

<!-- Quadrant micro-labels -->

<text x="68" y="56" font-size="8" fill="#9a958a" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">SLOW + EXPENSIVE</text>
<text x="372" y="56" text-anchor="end" font-size="8" fill="#9a958a" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">FAST + CHEAP</text>

<!-- ERP: high cost, slow adapt = bottom-left -->

<circle cx="115" cy="270" r="38" fill="#1a1a1a" fill-opacity=".06" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1"/>
<circle cx="115" cy="270" r="4" fill="#1a1a1a"/>
<text x="115" y="252" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1a1a" font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif">Cloud ERP</text>
<text x="115" y="295" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace">S$3M–15M · months</text>

<!-- LCAP: middle -->

<circle cx="220" cy="180" r="38" fill="#1a1a1a" fill-opacity=".06" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1"/>
<circle cx="220" cy="180" r="4" fill="#1a1a1a"/>
<text x="220" y="162" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1a1a" font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif">Low-Code</text>
<text x="220" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace">S$800K–3M · weeks</text>

<!-- No-Code: top-right -->

<circle cx="320" cy="95" r="40" fill="#1317E4" fill-opacity=".12" stroke="#1317E4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<circle cx="320" cy="95" r="4" fill="#1317E4"/>
