</svg>
</div>

<div class="card-story">"ERP costs millions and takes months to change. No-Code costs thousands and changes in hours."</div>

<dl class="card-meta">
<dt>Buyer mindset</dt><dd>CFO — money in, money out.</dd>
<dt>Strength</dt><dd>Universal recognition. Numbers speak.</dd>
<dt>Weakness</dt><dd>Frames Jodoo as the "cheap" option — risk of being seen as light-weight.</dd>
</dl>
</div>

<!-- FRAMING B: Organisational -->

<div class="card">
<div class="card-eyebrow">
<span>Framing B</span>
<span>Organisational</span>
</div>
<div class="card-title">Resource demand &times; Self-sufficiency</div>
<div class="card-axes">X-axis: <strong>Resource demand (capital + people + time)</strong><br>Y-axis: <strong>Operational self-sufficiency</strong></div>

<div class="card-svg">
<svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Organisational framing matrix">
<rect x="60" y="40" width="320" height="280" fill="#F7F5F0" stroke="#D7D0BF"/>
<line x1="220" y1="40" x2="220" y2="320" stroke="#D7D0BF" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
<line x1="60" y1="180" x2="380" y2="180" stroke="#D7D0BF" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>

<line x1="60" y1="340" x2="380" y2="340" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2"/>
<polyline points="375,336 383,340 375,344" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
<line x1="40" y1="320" x2="40" y2="40" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2"/>
<polyline points="36,46 40,38 44,46" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>

<text x="220" y="358" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">LOWER DEMAND →</text>
<text x="20" y="180" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1" transform="rotate(-90 20 180)">MORE SELF-SUFFICIENT →</text>

<text x="68" y="56" font-size="8" fill="#9a958a" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">NEEDS DEPARTMENT</text>
<text x="372" y="56" text-anchor="end" font-size="8" fill="#9a958a" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">NEEDS TRAINED STAFF</text>

<!-- ERP: high demand, low self-sufficiency -->

<circle cx="115" cy="270" r="38" fill="#1a1a1a" fill-opacity=".06" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1"/>
<circle cx="115" cy="270" r="4" fill="#1a1a1a"/>
<text x="115" y="252" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1a1a" font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif">Cloud ERP</text>
<text x="115" y="295" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace">IT dept + SI partner</text>

<!-- LCAP: middle -->

<circle cx="220" cy="180" r="38" fill="#1a1a1a" fill-opacity=".06" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1"/>
<circle cx="220" cy="180" r="4" fill="#1a1a1a"/>
<text x="220" y="162" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1a1a" font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif">Low-Code</text>
<text x="220" y="205" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace">In-house developers</text>

<!-- No-Code: top-right -->

<circle cx="320" cy="95" r="40" fill="#1317E4" fill-opacity=".12" stroke="#1317E4" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<circle cx="320" cy="95" r="4" fill="#1317E4"/>
<text x="320" y="76" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#1317E4" font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif">No-Code</text>
<text x="320" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#1317E4" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace">Trained ops staff</text>
</svg>
</div>

<div class="card-story">"ERP needs an IT department. Low-Code needs developers. No-Code needs trained operations staff."</div>

<dl class="card-meta">
<dt>Buyer mindset</dt><dd>MD / board — org structure &amp; hiring plan.</dd>
<dt>Strength</dt><dd>Maps directly to "do we need an IT team?" — answer the SME already knows.</dd>
<dt>Weakness</dt><dd>Less immediate than money. Requires the buyer to think one step.</dd>
</dl>
</div>

<!-- FRAMING C: Battlefield (RECOMMENDED) -->

<div class="card is-pick">
<div class="card-eyebrow">
<span>Framing C</span>
<span class="badge">Recommended</span>
</div>
<div class="card-title">Cost to evolve &times; Operational autonomy</div>
<div class="card-axes">X-axis: <strong>Cost of every change after deployment</strong><br>Y-axis: <strong>Operational autonomy (no outside help needed)</strong></div>

<div class="card-svg">
<svg viewBox="0 0 400 400" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Battlefield framing matrix — recommended">
<rect x="60" y="40" width="320" height="280" fill="#F7F5F0" stroke="#1317E4" stroke-opacity=".3"/>
<line x1="220" y1="40" x2="220" y2="320" stroke="#1317E4" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
<line x1="60" y1="180" x2="380" y2="180" stroke="#1317E4" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>

<line x1="60" y1="340" x2="380" y2="340" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2"/>
<polyline points="375,336 383,340 375,344" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>
<line x1="40" y1="320" x2="40" y2="40" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2"/>
<polyline points="36,46 40,38 44,46" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/>

<text x="220" y="358" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">CHEAPER TO CHANGE →</text>
<text x="20" y="180" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1" transform="rotate(-90 20 180)">MORE AUTONOMOUS →</text>

<text x="68" y="56" font-size="8" fill="#9a958a" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1">PAYS RENT TO CHANGE</text>
<text x="372" y="56" text-anchor="end" font-size="8" fill="#1317E4" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace" letter-spacing="1" font-weight="500">OWNS & EVOLVES</text>

<!-- ERP -->

<circle cx="115" cy="270" r="38" fill="#1a1a1a" fill-opacity=".06" stroke="#1a1a1a" stroke-width="1"/>
<circle cx="115" cy="270" r="4" fill="#1a1a1a"/>
<text x="115" y="252" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" font-weight="700" fill="#1a1a1a" font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif">Cloud ERP</text>
<text x="115" y="295" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#5e5e5e" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace">Consultant per change</text>

