<text x="320" y="74" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#1317E4" font-family="DM Sans,sans-serif">No-Code</text>
<text x="320" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-size="8" fill="#1317E4" font-family="JetBrains Mono,monospace">Staff edits live</text>

